{section:testimonials title='What builders say', tone='soft'}
  {section:item 'Ada Lovelace', role='Analyst'}The template asked for the numbers and they came. I never wrote a controller.{/section:item}
  {section:item 'Grace Hopper', role='Rear admiral'}It reads like the page it makes, so the next one to touch it understands it.{/section:item}
  {section:item 'Alan Turing', role='Mathematician'}Small files, plain names, and the whole page is right there.{/section:item}
{/section:testimonials}
